							]
						},
						"description": "Returns XSUAA service binding information.\n\n**Requires ADMIN scope** (admin role in xs-security.json)."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Get Tenant Dependencies",
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "bearer",
							"bearer": [
								{
									"key": "token",
									"value": "{{xsuaa_access_token}}",
									"type": "string"
								}
							]
						},
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{backend_host}}/callback/v1.0/dependencies",
							"host": [
								"{{backend_host}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"callback",
								"v1.0",
								"dependencies"
							]
						},
						"description": "Returns the list of service dependencies required for tenant subscription.\n\n**Called by SaaS Provisioning Service** - Requires `Callback` scope (granted to SaaS provisioning service).\n\n**Target:** Backend directly (not through Approuter) - SaaS Registry calls this URL.\n\n**Response:**\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"xsappname\": \"learning-management-system\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n**Note:** This endpoint is typically called by SAP BTP SaaS Provisioning Service, not by end users."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Subscribe Tenant",
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "bearer",
							"bearer": [
								{
									"key": "token",
									"value": "{{xsuaa_access_token}}",
									"type": "string"
								}
							]
						},
						"method": "PUT",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"subscribedSubdomain\": \"tenant-subdomain\",\n  \"subscribedTenantId\": \"tenant-guid\",\n  \"eventType\": \"CREATE\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{backend_host}}/callback/v1.0/tenants/{{tenantId}}",
							"host": [
								"{{backend_host}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"callback",
								"v1.0",
								"tenants",
								"{{tenantId}}"
							]
						},
						"description": "Handles tenant subscription callback from SaaS Provisioning Service.\n\n**Called by SaaS Provisioning Service** - Requires `Callback` scope.\n\n**Target:** Backend directly (not through Approuter) - SaaS Registry calls this URL.\n\n**Request Body (from SaaS Registry):**\n```json\n{\n  \"subscribedSubdomain\": \"subscriber-subaccount\",\n  \"subscribedTenantId\": \"tenant-guid\",\n  \"eventType\": \"CREATE\"\n}\n```\n\n**Response:** Returns tenant-specific Approuter URL:\n```\nhttps://subscriber-subaccount-lms-approuter.cfapps.us10-001.hana.ondemand.com/api/v1/application-info\n```\n\n**Note:** This endpoint is typically called by SAP BTP SaaS Provisioning Service during subscription flow."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Unsubscribe Tenant",
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "bearer",
							"bearer": [
								{
									"key": "token",
									"value": "{{xsuaa_access_token}}",
									"type": "string"
								}
							]
						},
						"method": "DELETE",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{backend_host}}/callback/v1.0/tenants/{{tenantId}}",
							"host": [
								"{{backend_host}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"callback",
								"v1.0",
								"tenants",
								"{{tenantId}}"
							]
						},
						"description": "Handles tenant unsubscription callback from SaaS Provisioning Service.\n\n**Called by SaaS Provisioning Service** - Requires `Callback` scope.\n\n**Target:** Backend directly (not through Approuter) - SaaS Registry calls this URL.\n\nThis endpoint:\n1. Cleans up tenant-specific data (if any)\n2. Removes tenant-specific configurations\n3. Returns 200 OK on success\n\n**Note:** This endpoint is typically called by SAP BTP SaaS Provisioning Service during unsubscription flow."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "SAP BTP Multitenancy endpoints for application management and tenant provisioning.\n\n## Endpoints:\n\n### Application Info (ADMIN only)\n- `GET /api/v1/application-info` - Returns XSUAA credentials\n- Requires `LMS_Admin` role collection\n\n### SaaS Provisioning Callbacks\n- `GET /callback/v1.0/dependencies` - Service dependencies\n- `PUT /callback/v1.0/tenants/{tenantId}` - Tenant subscription\n- `DELETE /callback/v1.0/tenants/{tenantId}` - Tenant unsubscription\n- Requires `Callback` scope (granted to SaaS Provisioning Service)\n\n## Setup:\n\n1. Assign `LMS_Admin` role collection to access application-info\n2. SaaS callbacks are called automatically by SAP BTP"
		},
